      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceDuration" : 7.532154195011338,
      "telop" : "「んっ…」僕はふと目が覚めると、窓から朝日が差し込んでいた。そして、ふとある違和感を感じ、隣を見る。",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "transitionName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "2026-10-25_16-14.pxd",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "duration" : 8.685419501133786,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_797_操夢.wav",
      "id" : "EEA4C76E-B96F-43E3-8363-DC94575C4BA5",
      "title" : "シーン 797",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #797",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.797.jpeg",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceDuration" : 8.685419501133786,
      "telop" : "僕は、隣を見た瞬間に、裸のフランを見てしまい、さっとベッドから飛び出る。そして、ふと手元を見ると僕も裸だった。",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "transitionName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "2026-10-25_16-14.pxd",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "duration" : 7.60172335600907,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_798_操夢.wav",
      "id" : "D34C580A-AB10-46B5-976D-2A0D7D3BAAFB",
      "title" : "シーン 798",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
