      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1339_古明地こいし.wav",
      "id" : "9DC827CE-CEE6-4F67-8384-89A4E7FC60AA",
      "title" : "シーン 1339",
